            1923                     !
            1924                     !  compute convective turn-over time
            1925                     !
            1926                     !> - Following Bechtold et al. (2008) \cite bechtold_et_al_2008, the
            1927                     !convective adjustment time (dtconv) is set to be proportional to the
            1928                     !convective turnover time, which is computed using the mean updraft
            1929                     !velocity (wc) and the cloud depth. It is also proportional to the grid
            1930                     !size (gdx).
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
                                   <<<    Standard iteration count: 243
                                   <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
